+       --stop-file "$PWD/tmp/stop-trace" --output "$PWD/tmp/session.trace"
    ```
    For interactive sessions, just tell the user to press Ctrl+C when done.
 4. **Signal stop** — when the user says they've finished exercising the app, `touch "$PWD/tmp/stop-trace"` (the project's own `tmp/` folder). The script cleanly SIGINTs xctrace and waits up to 60s for finalisation.
